WEBVTT

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.840
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.690
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:17.900
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.700
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:27.300
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.720
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:16.110
Marmo, the island
soaked in the blood...

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.990
of Kardis, goddess of
madness and destruction.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:23.820
Deep beneath ground so defiled
that it could not even...

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:25.940
be purified by Marfa,
the earth mother...

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:30.040
Kardis malevolently
awaits her rebirth.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.010
The resurrection requires
the sacrifice...

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.760
of a High Elf's eternal life.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:44.240
Knowing this, the Marmo
wizard Wagnard has...

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.500
acquired immense power
to control the dark goddess.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.020
With the Scepter
of Domination...

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:54.020
and Deedlit the High Elf
now safely in hand...

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.990
he is now prepared for
the resurrection ceremony.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.990
High Elf.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:05.990
In exchange for your life,
Kardis will be reborn.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.360
And when the world is swept
by darkness and destruction...

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:12.880
the one who possesses
the Scepter will not die.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:17.000
I shall control Kardis herself.

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:07.050
Parn.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:15.090
Should Kardis'
resurrection ceremony begin...

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:18.080
Deed's life will
hang by a thread.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.160
To begin the battle
to save her as soon as possible...

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.360
Parn and the others have arrived
in Marmo ahead of the main force.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.330
Damn those...!

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.330
The altar of the dark
god Falaris is up ahead!

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:41.490
And Deed's in there?

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.300
Most probably.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.300
Deed!

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.710
It's been awhile since
we've gone off together.

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:13.640
And the adversary we face
could well be a god.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.790
At least it's a
worthy foe, my lord.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.180
Perhaps a bit of bravado under
the circumstances isn't a bad thing.

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:24.470
But we must stop Kardis'
resurrection at any cost!

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.300
If we lose, then Lodoss is...

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.130
Highness!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:57.040
Show no fear!
Let loose the arrows!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.850
Hell's teeth, the ship...!

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:25.820
We <i>will</i> get to Marmo!
We will not die here!

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.490
We're supposed to be allies!

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:45.380
Not very friendly,
your going off to fight by yourselves!

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:58.310
What about you? I thought
you wanted out of this job.

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:01.950
I just don't like leaving them
to do stuff behind our backs!

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.880
If the powers of
darkness grow stronger...

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.800
Hyuri might
take control of me.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:11.780
So, even a berserker won't allow
the dark goddess to be reborn?

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:15.790
Hyuri wouldn't protect Shirts.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:11.660
Highness.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.600
Look well, Shadam.

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:17.330
Even if we make it back with our
skins, we'll never return here.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:20.020
Or rather, it will be
no place to return to!

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:22.830
To live as humans,
you mean.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:53.810
No time to look back!
Think only of moving forward!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.720
Damn you, Karla!

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.330
What are these
"scales of history?"

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:24.530
What is this
"balance of power?"

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:46.110
It can't be!

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:48.410
Slayn, what is it?

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.870
Kardis' evil is blossoming.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:53.420
The ceremony is
probably down there.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.470
Deed!

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:56.260
Parn!

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.640
Parn's in there!

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.150
Wait!

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:30.200
What's...?!

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:33.390
Narse, the Ancient
Dragon of Marmo.

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:35.800
If Narse has
shown himself, then...!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.650
To my staff I call the power
to turn back the darkness.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.120
Where...?

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.710
To think this is all under
the shrine to Falaris.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:03.000
As though Kardis were
asleep within Falaris' womb!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:07.520
Kardis was the goddess
of madness and destruction...

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:09.660
and a follower of Falaris.

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:14.480
When Lodoss was cleaved
away from the continent...

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:17.670
they say she fell
into a deathly sleep.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:29.550
What's...?

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:33.680
Kardis is awakening!
The ceremony must have begun.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.690
Deed!

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:16.850
Once the High Elf's eternal life
has been completely absorbed...

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.900
I will have fulfilled
all the commandments...

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:22.250
and the grand ancient
power will be reborn!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:36.250
Kardis! Dark goddess of
madness and destruction!

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.380
Obey the ancient covenant!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.870
Answer our summons to you!

00:13:57.210 --> 00:14:00.680
Kardis! Dark goddess of
madness and destruction!

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:04.850
Obey the ancient covenant!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:07.910
Answer our summons to you!

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.140
Parn.

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:51.120
What's wrong, Parn?

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.070
Careful, Parn!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.130
I hear you.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:30.240
Don't use your sword!
It uses its fluid as a weapon!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:39.330
Leylia!

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:44.750
Leylia!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:45.750
Stay back!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.760
We'll handle this!
Go on, Parn!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:49.720
Slayn?!

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:53.160
We can't let Wagnard
gain Kardis' power!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.570
And you're the only one
who can stop him, Parn!

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:58.720
Now go! Hurry!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.000
What are–?!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.080
Parn!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.050
Let's go!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:02.730
But...!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.850
Are you all right?

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:20.610
Yes.

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:22.620
Omnipotent power,
creator of all things!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.750
Throw off these false garments
and reveal your true form!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:33.090
Become a barrier
to protect us!

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:40.650
Keep away from the front!
You'll be caught in the flames!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.980
What's that thing's problem?!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:53.990
I'd say he doesn't want
us getting too close.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:55.700
He's in our way.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:58.430
Orson, it's impossible!

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:02.550
What's...?!

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:10.710
Mycen!

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:15.970
Right, we understand!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:20.600
Kashue! The gold dragon Mycen
will deal with Narse!

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:21.970
Don't worry!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:06.790
Is Kardis' resurrection necessary
to balance the scales of history?

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:13.670
For 500 years past
my soul has resided in this circlet.

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:17.880
All so that I could watch
over Lodoss. Nothing more.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.700
History must be written by humans.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.540
And you aren't one,
is that it?

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:25.790
You act as if you're the eyes of the
gods, looking down from the heavens.

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:30.790
Will those eyes watch silently
as Kardis is reborn?

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:32.640
Did I not tell you?

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:38.800
I exist for one purpose.
To protect Lodoss from destruction.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:51.720
You give your life for
a magnificent goddess!

00:18:57.370 --> 00:18:58.320
You?!

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:04.970
When did I ever allow you
to do whatever you pleased?

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:09.280
Who carried you
back from hell?!

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:13.890
I see. You've thrown
your lot in with that witch!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:20.160
The powers of the gods
are beyond your abilities.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.720
A man should know his limits.

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:27.220
Unfortunately for you, I'm not
the one who has to control it.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:28.980
Kardis is!

00:19:58.830 --> 00:19:59.780
Parn!

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.530
Etoh!

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:20.240
It's all right!
I'll handle this!

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.160
Get going, Parn!

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:22.150
Are you crazy?!

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:25.200
By the awesome powers
of Falis!

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:28.470
Prayers will do more
against them than swords.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.320
Don't worry! Just go!

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:31.000
Etoh!

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:41.840
Go now! Hurry, Parn!
If you don't, then Deed...!

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:46.040
Why do you think
we came here?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:49.760
If you save Deed,
you save all of Lodoss!

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:55.030
I'm glad we made it
this far together.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.440
Etoh.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.080
By the glory of Falis!

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:28.800
You wish to continue
living in shame?

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:33.390
Neither Marmo nor Lodoss
is your plaything!

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:35.950
Mere trifles, at best!

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:40.170
When the powers of the gods are
mine, nothing else will matter!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:44.580
What I desire is POWER!

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:46.550
And when those of
the gods are my own...

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:48.660
I will be the greatest
wizard of all time!

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:26.340
Pathetic fool! Now know
the depths of your error.

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:43.060
Parn, forgive me.

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:45.700
I can't.

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:58.410
As Kardis' rebirth draws near,
I make my way to her altar.

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:01.090
Before Deed's eyes,
as her life's fires flicker away...

00:23:01.090 --> 00:23:03.900
I face Ashram
in our final battle!

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:07.070
Deed.
I won't let you die!

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:09.960
Next time,
on Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:09.960 --> 00:23:13.280
The final episode -
"Lodoss - The Burning Continent"

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:16.200
I will defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
